&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-01-17T18:46:56+08:00 Updated on: 2026-01-17T18:51:39.817+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;【渣馬/】渣馬明日開賽！城巴及九巴共安排了31條路線以便跑手在清晨可以前往尖東及維多利亞公園。而港鐵則會港鐵共有八條鐵路線的頭班車會在星期日適時提早開出，其中屯馬線及東鐵線（上水往金鐘）的頭班車最早於凌晨3時25分開出。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_1200.png" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_600.png" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_1024.png" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_600.png" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_300.png" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="港鐵服務。（運輸署）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_1200.png" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1763244_1200.png" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 港鐵服務。（運輸署）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;城巴表示，為配合「香港馬拉松 2026」，將於活動當日開辦共9條馬拉松特別路線，方便健兒由各區出發，前往馬拉松起步點。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_1200.png" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_600.png" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_1024.png" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_600.png" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_300.png" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="城巴服務（城巴）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_1200.png" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1754057_1200.png" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 城巴服務（城巴）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;九巴則表示，為配合明日舉行的「渣打香港馬拉松」，將開辦22條特別線，由多區接載馬拉松選手前往賽事起點，方便選手可以一程直達。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;全馬及半馬&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;參加全馬及半馬的選手，可以選乘下列11條特別線，直達尖沙咀東（麼地道），再步行前往位於彌敦道的起步點。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_1200.png" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_600.png" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_1024.png" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_600.png" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_300.png" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="九巴服務。（九巴）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_1200.png" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755824_1200.png" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 九巴服務。（九巴）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;十公里賽事&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;九巴指，參加十公里的選手，可以選乘下列11條特別線，直達銅鑼灣（維多利亞公園），再步行前往位於東區走廊的起步點。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_1200.png" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_600.png" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_1024.png" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_600.png" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_300.png" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="九巴服務。（九巴）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_1200.png" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4070131/2026-01-1755845_1200.png" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 九巴服務。（九巴）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;HKET App已全面升級，TOPick為大家推出一系列親子、健康、娛樂、港聞及休閒生活資訊及影片。立即下載︰&lt;a href="https://onelink.to/f92q4m"&gt;https://onelink.to/f92q4m&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
